1
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:04,680
如果我吃点什么来催眠
If I take something to help me sleep,

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,780
明天开会就会昏昏沉沉的
I'll be groggy for the meeting.

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,180
但如果我什么也不吃 就睡不着
But if I don't take anything and I don't sleep,

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,900
明天开会还是会昏昏沉沉的
I'll be groggy for the meeting, you know?

5
00:00:11,413 --> 00:00:13,480
我在再次竞选当地房地产经纪人团体的
I was up for re-election as social chair

6
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,860
联谊会主席
of our local realtors group.

7
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,160
今晚进行投票
The vote was tonight.

8
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,620
我超级紧张
I was so nervous,

9
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,380
基本没在听克莱尔为我鼓励
I could barely hear Claire's pep talk.

10
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,020
我为什么求米奇尔
Why did I beg Mitchell

11
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,180
介绍我认识这个开发商
to introduce me to this developer?

12
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,240
你说得对 我们很快就会知道了
You're right. We'll know soon enough.

13
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,647
我要上楼了 看看能不能睡着
I'm gonna go upstairs, see if I can get some sleep.

14
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:26,180
爱你
Love you.

15
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,700
我也希望这样
I hope so, too.

16
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,040
你好
Hello?

17
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:32,640
格尔
Hey, Gil.

18
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,921
没没没 你没吵醒我
No, no, no. You -- you didn't wake me.

19
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,960
你有听到什么消息吗
Um, so, you hear anything, or...

20
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:41,240
邓菲
Hey, Dunphy.

21
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,840
稍等我挂断这个蠢货的电话
Just wrapping up a phone call with this jackass.

22
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,960
我得挂了 邓菲
I got to run, Dunphy.

23
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,200
晚上得跟个蠢货见面
I got a late meeting with some jackass.

24
00:00:45,224 --> 00:00:47,491
什么情 什么情况
What's going o-- what's going on?

25
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,400
大家都表态了 邓菲
The people have spoken, Dunphy.

26
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,780
我当选了 你出局了
I'm in. You're out.

27
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:52,680
很抱歉不得不私下告诉你
Sorry to have to tell you that in private.

28
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,220
票数接近吗
Was it even close?

29
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,100
不 我现在受命要做个工作
No! I have a mandate --

30
00:00:56,161 --> 00:00:58,429
不是需要跟老婆隐瞒的那种
Not the kind you hide from your wife, either.

31
00:00:58,429 --> 00:01:00,140
难以置信 我才任一届吗
I can't believe it. I'm a one-termer?

32
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:01,960
那我就跟亨利·尤斯塔斯·泰勒
That puts me alongside Henry Eustace Tyler

33
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:02,780
还有阿特·瓦格纳一样了
and Art Wagner!

34
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,120
从没见过阿特·瓦格纳
Never met Art Wagner.

35
00:01:04,258 --> 00:01:07,283
"Gategate"事件后 他的经纪人执照被吊销了
They took away his realtor's license after Gategate.

36
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,540
别再追忆历史了 "蹬腿"
Okay, enough history, "Done-for."

37
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:10,280
快把东西交出来
Fork over the hardware.

38
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,920
格尔 正如我的前任对我说的那样
Gil, as my predecessor told me,

39
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:15,620
尊重办公室 尊重奖章
respect the office, respect the medallion.

40
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:17,820
真够闪的
Ooh, shiny.

41
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:19,188
你多长时间清理一次这玩意儿
How often do you clean this thing?

42
00:01:19,188 --> 00:01:20,687
我每次洗澡的时候
Every time I shower.

43
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,000
别担心 晚上这奖章
Well, don't worry. It's gonna get a good buffing tonight

44
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,860
在我老婆脑后摇晃时就能好好磨光一下了
when it's swinging against the back of my wife's head.

45
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:28,511
这可不是尊重奖章的表现
That is not respecting the medall--

46
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:47,280
等我们拿完我的过敏药
So, after we pick up my allergy medication,

47
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,320
你把我和曼尼载到博物馆
you drop Manny and I at the museum.

48
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:50,920
你为什么非得去
Why do you even have to go?

49
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:53,680
其他母亲也会参加这次活动
Ay, other mothers are going to the field trip, too.

50
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,420
别担心
Don't worry.

51
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:57,040
我不会缠着你
I'm not going to be all over you,

52
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,460
让你感觉压抑的
trying to suffocate you.

53
00:01:58,620 --> 00:01:59,680
别那样说话
Don't talk like that.

54
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,660
我讨厌拥挤的电梯
I hate crowded elevators.

55
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,680
只有一件事更讨厌
Only one thing worse --

56
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,680
那就是电梯停了 你被困在里面
When they stop and you get trapped.

57
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:12,060
其实 还有一件事更讨厌
Actually, there's one thing even worse than that.

58
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:14,740
没关系 先生 不用怕
It's okay, sir. There's no need to panic.

59
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,460
跟他一起被困住
Getting trapped with him.

60
00:02:18,140 --> 00:02:19,260
我不知道这家伙的名字
I don't even know the guy's name.

61
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,220
他跟我同个俱乐部的
He belongs to my club.

62
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:21,980
但不知道为什么
But for whatever reason,

63
00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:25,080
他总是有办法
he has the knack for showing up

64
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:27,500
在我最糟糕的时候出现
when I'm at my absolute worst.

65
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:31,520
马上回来
Be right back.

66
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,360
来 我来帮你
Here, let me help you.

67
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,440
也许我们该帮帮别人
Maybe we should help someone else.

68
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,560
别害怕
Oh, don't be frightened.

69
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,320
跨大步
Big step!

70
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:51,980
谁是下一个
Who's next?

71
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,800
抱歉 胡娇要给你们的婚礼找什么
I'm sorry. Pepper's getting a what for your wedding?

72
00:02:55,808 --> 00:02:56,658
一名摄指
A D.P.

73
00:02:57,087 --> 00:02:57,577
不是
No!

74
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,520
不 是摄影指导
No, a director of photography.

75
00:03:00,380 --> 00:03:01,600
显然 他是个大咖
Yeah, apparently, he's a big deal.

76
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,480
他获得过金球奖
He won a Golden Globe.

77
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,680
不 奥斯卡是靠实力赢的
No, you win an Oscar.

78
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,600
金球奖是花钱买的
You buy a Golden Globe.

79
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:07,240
他只能今早跟我们见面
So he can only meet with us this morning.

80
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,364
你今天能去学校接莉莉吗
Is -- is there any way you could pick Lily up from school?

81
00:03:09,364 --> 00:03:10,447
行啊 行 没问题
Uh, yeah. Yeah, I can.

82
00:03:10,447 --> 00:03:12,140
我会 我会带她去公园 很好
I'll -- I-I'll take her to the park. That's good.

83
00:03:12,140 --> 00:03:13,600
这样我就不会去想跟你朋友见面的事了
It'll get my mind off this meeting with your friend.

84
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,540
我好紧张
I am so nervous.

85
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:17,853
我很久没开过销售会议了
I haven't had a sales meeting in...forever.

86
00:03:17,863 --> 00:03:18,972
现在有点迟钝了
I'm a little rusty.

87
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,320
你还记得我们以前总叫你小迟钝吗
Do you remember when we used to call you "Little rusty"?

88
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:22,460
我那时才8岁
I was 8,

89
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:23,980
现在我还是可以取消这次会面
and I can still cancel this meeting.

90
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:26,171
好吧 我得挂了 我得
Fine. I got to go. I got to --

91
00:03:26,940 --> 00:03:28,700
我不知道我得干什么
I don't know what I have to do.

92
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:29,920
这是干什么
What is this?

93
00:03:30,355 --> 00:03:32,640
我在为了我的摔跤比赛流汗减重
I'm sweating off weight for my wrestling match.

94
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,640
我就是穿这个睡觉的
I slept in this.

95
00:03:33,740 --> 00:03:36,260
这就是为什么我们找不到塑料包装用吗
Does this have anything to do with why we're out of plastic wrap?

96
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,620
那是最里面一层
Oh, it's the bottom layer.

97
00:03:37,620 --> 00:03:38,900
而且我告诉你吧
And I've got some news for you --

98
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:39,960
那东西并不能让我保持新鲜
It's not keeping me fresh.

99
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,410
好吧 你要迟到了
Okay. Um, you're gonna be late.

100
00:03:41,410 --> 00:03:43,230
你在后座脱衣服吧
You got to get undressed in the backseat.

101
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,860
要给他什么指示吗
Ooh, got any pointers for him?

102
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:45,980
你们非得现在搬这个吗
Do you girls have to move that now?

103
00:03:45,980 --> 00:03:47,160
我最近感觉很孤单
Well, I've been lonely.

104
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,200
屋子放面镜子会让我感觉有个伴
Having a mirror in my room will be like having company!

105
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:50,996
你女儿真是只害怕孤独的小鹦鹉
Ugh, your daughter's a parakeet.

106
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:52,980
小心点
Careful.

107
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,340
别再说了 我知道我在
Stop saying that. I think I know what I'm --

108
00:03:55,340 --> 00:03:55,960
等一下
Oh, one second.

109
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:57,862
-天啊 -你好
- Oh, my God. - Hello!

110
00:03:58,478 --> 00:03:59,753
不会 现在正合适
No, this is a good time.

111
00:03:59,753 --> 00:04:01,860
-海莉 -好了 天啊
- Haley! - All right. Geez!

112
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:03,690
没事 我在帮我妹妹做点事儿
No, I just got to help my sister out with something.

113
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:04,460
再见
Okay. Bye.

114
00:04:04,980 --> 00:04:06,680
我们把这个放下一会儿
Okay, let's just put this down for a second.

115
00:04:06,769 --> 00:04:07,976
天啊
Oh, my God.

116
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,840
-怎么了 -恐怕这面镜子放不下
- What? - I don't think this is gonna fit.

117
00:04:11,940 --> 00:04:12,920
你得找一面小点的镜子
You'll have to get a smaller mirror.

118
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,680
天啊 天啊 天啊
Oh, my God! Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

119
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,580
海莉 换面镜子你身材又不会变
Haley, you'll still be the same size in it.

120
00:04:16,580 --> 00:04:17,080
不
No!

121
00:04:18,660 --> 00:04:19,880
天呐 我们被困住了
Oh, my God! We're trapped!

122
00:04:19,972 --> 00:04:22,160
这 这 这没什么大不了的
Well, it -- it's -- it's not such a huge disaster.

123
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,420
只是你上学会迟到一会儿而已
You know, you'll just be a little late for school.

124
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,840
再好好想想 到底是哪样
Make up your mind! Which is it?!

125
00:04:25,380 --> 00:04:27,180
天呐 我错过了一条短信
Oh, my god. I'm missing a text.

126
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,800
来真的了 是不是
Just got real, didn't it?

127
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,020
谁派你来的
Who sent you?!

128
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,580
快点 我们得走了 可不能迟到
Come on. We have to go. We can't be late.

129
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,640
我太激动了 你呢
I am so excited. Aren't you?

130
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,540
-不是吧 -什么 怎么了
- Oh, no. - What? What's happening?

131
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:39,500
又要搞砸吗
How are you ruining this?

132
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,260
莉莉的班上有虱子
There's a report of lice in Lily's class.

133
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:43,260
估计是从波西亚那传来的
Ugh. It's probably from Portia.

134
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:44,880
她总是特别脏
You know, she is always so filthy.

135
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:46,380
他们不跟她一起游泳了
They had to kick her out of swim buddies

136
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:47,960
因为她有次落了个游泳圈在泳池周围
because she left a ring around the pool.

137
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:50,100
我们大概应该取消会议
We should probably cancel our meeting

138
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:51,780
亲自去接莉莉
and pick Lily up ourselves, huh?

139
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:54,220
不是大概 是必须
Probably? We have to!

140
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,840
我们不能为了
We can't risk infecting Claire

141
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,940
和全国最棒的婚礼摄影师见面
just so we can keep a meeting

142
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:59,360
就让克莱尔有被传染虱子的风险
with the top wedding photographer in the state.

143
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,880
不 不
No. No.

144
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:06,320
我这就打给她
I am calling her.

145
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,180
没错 这就对了
Yeah, it's the right thing to do...

146
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,760
即使基本没可能
...even though it's like a 1% chance

147
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,060
会传染给她
of her actually catching anything

148
00:05:12,060 --> 00:05:14,760
倒是很可能吓死她
and a 100% chance of us freaking her out.

149
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,540
别 等等
Well, now, wait.

150
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:18,920
我们是不是有点自私 小卡
Are we being selfish here, Cam?

151
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:21,480
也许 说下去
Maybe. Go on.

152
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,320
要是我们提醒她
Well, if-- if we alarm her just so

153
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:24,700
只是为了不让自己良心不安
that we can have a clear conscience,

154
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:25,660
会不会显得我们太
doesn't that make us...

155
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:27,480
-冷酷 -冷酷
- Monsters. - ...monsters.

156
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,060
我们何不帮她个忙
Wouldn't we be doing her a favor

157
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:31,620
就不告诉她 省得她担心呢
by not telling her and sparing her all that worry?

158
00:05:31,780 --> 00:05:32,920
今天帮她的第二个大忙
Second huge favor of the day,

159
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,400
你还帮她约了你的客户和她见面
after you got her a meeting with your client.

160
00:05:35,117 --> 00:05:37,280
我有点负罪感
Mm. I'm -- I'm starting to feel bad about this.

161
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,580
怎么了 因为我们帮了她太多忙
What, because we're doing so many favors,

162
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,180
可克莱尔却报答不了吗
Claire will never be able to pay us back?

163
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,040
谢谢
Thank you.

164
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:43,000
好 就不给她添加压力了 小卡
Nope, she does not need the stress, Cam.

165
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:45,000
好的 就这样 不再帮克莱尔了
Yep. That's it. No more favors for Claire.

166
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,900
不帮了
No!

167
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,240
看我们
Look at us!

168
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,400
两个金发女郎 真开心
Two blondes, having fun!

169
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,440
伙计
Hey, buddy!

170
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,880
比赛快开始了
My match is coming up.

171
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,300
有什么最后的"父建"
Got any final dad-vice?

172
00:05:56,300 --> 00:05:57,640
这个词开始听习惯了吧
Starting to sound natural, right?

173
00:05:58,580 --> 00:06:00,740
没别的 去好好享受比赛就好了
You know what? Just get out there and enjoy yourself.

174
00:06:00,924 --> 00:06:03,120
你尝试了一项新的运动 很棒
You showed real character trying a new sport.

175
00:06:03,620 --> 00:06:05,560
不管结果如何 我都为你骄傲
No matter what happens, I couldn't be prouder.

176
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:06,440
谢谢 爸爸
Thanks, dad.

177
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,768
加油 打败他们
You bet. Go get 'em!

178
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:11,400
这可能是当家长最棒的一件事
That may be the best part about being a parent.

179
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,380
不管你自己的生活如何
Whatever's going on in your personal life,

180
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:14,800
你的孩子高兴 你也会高兴
when your kid's happy, you're happy.

181
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,220
一个开心的孩子就像抗抑郁药
A happy kid is like an antidepressant,

182
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,400
而且是纯天然的
but a natural one,

183
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:19,660
不是需要背着老公藏在
not the kind your husband has to find

184
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:20,880
首饰盒里的那种
in your jewelry drawer.

185
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,420
说多了
Enough said about that!

186
00:06:27,780 --> 00:06:28,440
格尔你好
Hey, Gil.

187
00:06:28,620 --> 00:06:30,060
真抱歉啊
Oh, whoops! I'm sorry, man.

188
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:31,250
希望没晃瞎你眼睛
I hope I didn't blind ya.

189
00:06:31,260 --> 00:06:33,360
尽管你可能不会想看接下来的画面
Although you might not want to see what's next.

190
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:35,400
我们的孩子要比赛摔跤
Our kids are wrestling each other.

191
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:36,740
-你在开玩笑吧 -没有
- Are you kidding? - Nope!

192
00:06:37,753 --> 00:06:39,699
那个就是我的小选手
There's my little bra-snapper right there.

193
00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:41,920
他可是很生猛的
He's a beast, man.

194
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,095
是啊是啊
No, uh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

195
00:06:43,095 --> 00:06:43,660
我明白
No, I get it.

196
00:06:43,660 --> 00:06:45,140
你想吓唬我
This is when you try to intimidate me.

197
00:06:45,380 --> 00:06:46,880
不不 祝你好运
No! No. Hey, good luck.

198
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:49,060
你听没听说过
Hey, did you ever hear about those

199
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:51,534
边境那些非法的童子摔跤比赛
illegal baby-fighting rings they got in the border?

200
00:06:51,716 --> 00:06:52,535
那都是假的
That's not a real thing.

201
00:06:52,544 --> 00:06:54,258
我和我太太带他去参加过
Yeah, wife and I brought him down there.

202
00:06:54,874 --> 00:06:56,471
赢了一整车鸡回来
Won a whole carload of chickens.

203
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:57,840
回头见了伙计
See you out there, man.

204
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:00,060
那根本没有的事
That never happened!

205
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,860
注意 注意
Watch yourself! Watch yourself!

206
00:07:02,660 --> 00:07:03,180
祝我好运吧
Wish me luck.

207
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:04,340
不需要了 你很努力了
No need. You worked hard.

208
00:07:04,340 --> 00:07:05,280
我只希望你开心就好
I just want you to have fun.

209
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,100
谢谢 爸爸
Thanks, dad.

210
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:07,240
另外我还想修正一下
Also, I'd like to revise

211
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,600
我在车上跟你说的咬人的事
what I said to you in the car about biting.

212
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:14,160
曼尼 这里什么都有
Manny, they have everything here--

213
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:17,160
雨林体验 飓风室
the rainforest experience, the hurricane booth,

214
00:07:17,420 --> 00:07:18,580
人体解析
discovering the body --

215
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:20,580
这个哥伦比亚也有 只是
We have that one in Colombia, too, but --

216
00:07:20,580 --> 00:07:21,960
形式不同
but a different kind.

217
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:25,200
-不 -怎么了
- Oh, no. - What?

218
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,200
你没听到吗
You don't hear that?

219
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:31,260
是我的新鞋 吱吱响
It's my new shoes. They're squeaking.

220
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,840
那就轻点走
Then walk softer.

221
00:07:35,101 --> 00:07:36,215
完了
Oh, great.

222
00:07:36,215 --> 00:07:38,080
地板就像猫玩具做的
It sounds like the floor's made of cat toys.

223
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,280
-我完了 -为什么
- I'm screwed! - Why?

224
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:42,100
为什么 因为这些孩子会取笑任何事
Why? Because these kids make fun of everything.

225
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:44,300
让他们揪着这事 我会永世不得脱身
Hand them this, it'll stick with me forever.

226
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:45,840
咕哝就是这样
That's what happened to mumbles.

227
00:07:46,420 --> 00:07:48,260
曼尼 来跟我们走
Hey, Manny, come with us.

228
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,600
走吧 咕哝
Let's go, mumbles.

229
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:51,300
就那一次
One time!

230
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:53,300
走吧
Let's go.

231
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:54,420
我不去了
Just go on without me.

232
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:55,520
我就在这站着吧
I'm just gonna stand here.

233
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,560
永远站着吗
What -- forever?

234
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:00,360
他这是怎么了
What happened to him?

235
00:08:00,518 --> 00:08:02,600
上高中前 他没有这么强烈的
He didn't used to be that self-conscious

236
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,680
自我意识
before high school.

237
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:05,960
他以前就披着斗篷
He used to go around in his poncho,

238
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:07,440
吹着排箫
play the pan flute.

239
00:08:07,679 --> 00:08:10,682
真想念我的小曼尼
Ay, I miss my little old Manny.

240
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:14,760
曼尼 你太在意别人怎么想了
Manny, you care too much about what other people think!

241
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:16,900
我知道这里有些母亲
I know that some of the mothers here

242
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:17,900
也想取笑我
want to make fun of me

243
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:21,040
因为我有口音和有弹性的胸部
because of my accent and my bouncy bosom.

244
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:22,780
可她们没有 知道为什么吗
But they don't. You know why?

245
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:25,700
因为我不在乎 因为我充满自信
Because I don't care. Because I walk with confidence.

246
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,380
你也可以 我们走
And so can you. Let's go.

247
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:31,320
这地方真差劲
This place sucks so bad.

248
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:32,440
可不是么 咯咯笑
Sure does, giggles.

249
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:33,560
我就那么笑了一次
One time!

250
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,920
好吧 她还没走
Okay, she's not leaving.

251
00:08:38,457 --> 00:08:40,440
你得把她从楼梯上引开
You got to lure her away from the staircase.

252
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,060
她肯定相信你
She'll trust you.

253
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:42,550
你穿得像个驯兽员
You're kind of dressed like an animal trainer.

254
00:08:42,550 --> 00:08:43,680
你为什么一直觉得它是母的
Why do you keep calling it a "She"?

255
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:46,160
因为公的不会那样看我
Well, because "He"s don't look at me like that.

256
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,740
天啊 她打算睡上一整天吗
My god, is she gonna sleep all day long?

257
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,020
真的吗 你还嫌人家睡得多
Okay, that, coming from you?

258
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:50,620
那负鼠肯定乐坏了
The possum's actually laughing.

259
00:08:50,620 --> 00:08:53,460
而且 它显然没在睡觉
And, besides, I mean, it's obviously not sleeping.

260
00:08:53,460 --> 00:08:54,840
她还能干什么
What else would she be doing?

261
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:56,000
装[玩]...
Playing...?

262
00:08:56,016 --> 00:08:58,260
玩...什么
Playing...what?

263
00:08:58,260 --> 00:08:59,120
我的天啊
Oh, my god!

264
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:00,740
装死 人人都知道
Playing possum, the one thing

265
00:09:00,740 --> 00:09:03,120
这是负鼠最擅长干的事
that absolutely everyone knows possums do.

266
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,760
骗到你了
Ha, ha! I got you!

267
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:06,540
我像负鼠那样跟你装傻呢 我假装
I was playing possum on you by pretending --

268
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,880
不 别糊弄我 想都不要想
Yeah, no, no, no, no, no. Don't even.

269
00:09:08,180 --> 00:09:08,740
不 上帝啊
No, my god.

270
00:09:08,740 --> 00:09:10,009
妈妈要到5点才能回家
Mom's not even here until 5:00.

271
00:09:10,020 --> 00:09:11,580
你还把唯一一个能量棒给吃了
And you ate our only power bar.

272
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:12,920
可能就是那个把它吸引来的
Well, that's probably what attracted it!

273
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,608
我们得朝它扔点儿什么
You know, we got to throw something at it.

274
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:14,740
好吧
Fine.

275
00:09:16,380 --> 00:09:17,480
你疯了吗
Are you crazy?!

276
00:09:19,677 --> 00:09:21,088
博洛先生马上就来见您
Mr. Perlowe will be right with you.

277
00:09:21,088 --> 00:09:22,337
-谢谢 -谢谢你
- Thank you. - Thank you.

278
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:26,580
我之前特别紧张 不过我觉得我能搞定
I was so nervous before, but I think I really got this.

279
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,300
不是吧
Oh, no!

280
00:09:28,020 --> 00:09:29,120
什么 怎么了
What? What's happening?

281
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,160
又要搞砸吗
How are you ruining this?

282
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:31,480
为什么每个人都这么说我
Why does everybody say that?

283
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,980
那个 我们今早见的
The -- the director of photography

284
00:09:32,980 --> 00:09:34,820
摄像指导拒绝了我们
we met with this morning --he's turning us down.

285
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:35,220
为什么
Why?

286
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:37,120
创意分歧
"Creative differences."

287
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,320
他建议我们其中一人在襟花上
He suggested one of us wear a hidden camera

288
00:09:39,320 --> 00:09:40,000
装个隐藏相机
in our boutonniere.

289
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,420
他管这个叫"看得见风景的新郎"
He called it "Groom with a view."

290
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:44,026
某人却想把它叫做"小卡摄影"
Somebody got it into his head to call it the "Cam-cam."

291
00:09:44,026 --> 00:09:45,345
于是就有了各种跳脚
Then there was a lot of foot-stomping

292
00:09:45,345 --> 00:09:47,440
折手杖 摔单眼镜
and cane-snapping and monocle-smashing.

293
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,120
你们的婚礼摄影师是谁 小花生先生吗
Who is your wedding photographer -- Mr. Peanut?

294
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,622
他是指导
It's a director of --

295
00:09:50,842 --> 00:09:51,913
-婚礼而已 -抱歉我迟到了
- It's a wedding. - Sorry I'm late.

296
00:09:51,913 --> 00:09:52,858
吉姆·博洛
Jim Perlowe,

297
00:09:52,858 --> 00:09:54,780
这是我姐姐 克莱尔·邓菲
this is my sister, Claire Dunphy.

298
00:09:54,780 --> 00:09:56,080
你好 很高兴见到你
Hi. A pleasure to meet you.

299
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,980
我今天早上路过工地了
Listen, I went by the construction site this morning,

300
00:09:57,980 --> 00:10:00,340
那些公寓肯定会建得非常棒
and those condos are gonna be fantastic --

301
00:10:00,340 --> 00:10:02,900
当然 前提是要有好的衣柜和百叶窗
Assuming, of course, you get the right closets and blinds.

302
00:10:02,900 --> 00:10:05,493
看来会议已经开始了 那么 好吧
Of cour-- appears the meeting has already started, so, okay!

303
00:10:05,493 --> 00:10:07,380
是的开始了 再见 米奇尔
Yes, it has! Bye-bye, Mitchell!

304
00:10:09,721 --> 00:10:12,504
-我们继续吗 -是的 当然
- Shall we? - Yes, absolutely! So...

305
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:15,760
你好啊小懒虫
Hey, sleepy!

306
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:17,460
今天午睡得真久
Long nap today.

307
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,740
你和克莱尔肯定在公园玩得很累吧
Claire must've really worn you out at the park, huh?

308
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:20,380
是的
Yeah.

309
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:22,700
你想和我一起躺着吗 大爸
Do you want to lie down with me, daddy?

310
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:26,020
亲爱的 我拒绝这个要求的那一天
Oh, honey, the day I answer no to that question...

311
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:27,860
就是今天
...is today.

312
00:10:28,420 --> 00:10:29,700
你去哪里
Where are you going?

313
00:10:29,700 --> 00:10:31,062
我打电话给二爸
I got to call daddy.

314
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,740
你应该知道我们的优势不仅在于
You should know that it's not just our low prices

315
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:34,720
价格低廉
that set us apart.

316
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:36,740
我们还有丰富的经验
It's our level of experience.

317
00:10:36,740 --> 00:10:38,327
我以前见过
You know,I have seen it before

318
00:10:38,327 --> 00:10:41,012
一个新手走进一个不规则空间
a new guy walks into an irregular-shaped space,

319
00:10:41,012 --> 00:10:43,917
他会说 我们应该从哪开始呢
and he's just like, "Ugh! Where do we even start?"

320
00:10:45,385 --> 00:10:47,122
从测量开始 也许
You start with measurements, maybe.

321
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,100
喂 小卡 什么事
Hey, Cam, what's up?

322
00:10:49,340 --> 00:10:51,000
正式确认某人头上有虱子了
Well, it's official. Someone has lice.

323
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,020
大爸 抱抱我
Daddy, hug me!

324
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,900
我也想啊 但是要记得这块地毯是岩浆
I would, but remember, the carpet's hot lava!

325
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:55,940
是的 热的岩浆
Yeah, hot lava!

326
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:58,200
天啊 你确定吗
Oh, my god. Are you sure?

327
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,320
确定
I think so.

328
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:01,160
她的脑袋跟跳跳糖一样噼啪响
Her head sounds like pop rocks.

329
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:02,660
你得警告克莱尔
You have to warn Claire.

330
00:11:03,084 --> 00:11:05,120
大爸 这个游戏不好玩
Daddy, this game is mean.

331
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,180
你知道吗 亲爱的
Well, you know what, sweetie?

332
00:11:07,765 --> 00:11:09,978
好吧 不 保持镇定
All right. No. J-just stay calm.

333
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:12,780
首先 如果你需要我做什么
First of all, if there's anything that you need from me,

334
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:13,580
不管是什么
anything at all,

335
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:15,420
我就住在使馆套房
I will be living at the embassy suites.

336
00:11:15,688 --> 00:11:17,500
其次 她也不一定
Secondly, there's -- there's no guarantee

337
00:11:17,500 --> 00:11:18,400
会被传染上
that she has it.

338
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,940
我现在就和她在一起
I mean, I'm with her right now.

339
00:11:19,940 --> 00:11:21,000
如果她有虱子我会知道的
I think I'd know.

340
00:11:23,580 --> 00:11:24,780
好吧 我想我知道了
Yeah, I think I know.

341
00:11:26,140 --> 00:11:29,200
所以 像你看到的 这些都是模板
So, as you can see, all of them are modules,

342
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,240
他们可以根据各个房间而定制 米奇尔
So they can be customized for each unit -- Mitchell!

343
00:11:31,340 --> 00:11:32,080
你们好啊
Hey! Hi!

344
00:11:32,180 --> 00:11:33,400
那个 克莱尔 我需要跟你谈谈
So, claire, I need to talk to you.

345
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,680
是 好 等我们谈完的
Yeah, right -- right when we're done.

346
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:35,380
等开完会之后
Just after the meeting.

347
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:37,481
- 我们有松木 杉木 - 这事很重要
- We got pine, cedar... - It's kind of important.

348
00:11:37,753 --> 00:11:39,300
事实上 我得接这个电话
A-actually, I got to take this call.

349
00:11:39,300 --> 00:11:40,200
-抱歉 -好的
- Excuse me. - Okay.

350
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:42,100
你怎么了
What is going on with you?

351
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,800
是这样 你发现你一直在挠头了吧
Okay, so, you know how you've been scratching your head?

352
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:45,000
我的天 有这么明显吗
Oh, god. Is it that noticeable?

353
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,720
我有点儿神经性痉挛
I-I have some kind of nervous tic.

354
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,600
是 可能也有这个原因
Yeah, there might be one of those in there, too.

355
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:51,406
那个 莉莉在学校染上虱子了
Um, so, lily brought home lice from school.

356
00:11:51,820 --> 00:11:52,180
什么
What?

357
00:11:52,180 --> 00:11:53,900
是的 事实上 我本来想告诉你的
Yeah, and, actually, I would've told you,

358
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:55,240
但小卡觉得也许
but Cam thought that maybe --

359
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,200
你让我顶着
You let me walk around

360
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,920
啃我脑壳的虫子走来走去
with insects gnawing on my skull,

361
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:59,000
竟然不告诉我吗
and you said nothing?

362
00:11:59,060 --> 00:11:59,900
是 但是克莱尔
Yeah, but, Claire --

363
00:11:59,900 --> 00:12:00,700
给我过来 小迟钝
Come here, little rusty.

364
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,800
不 你听我说
No, listen, you --

365
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:04,140
什么样的禽兽为了自身利益
What kind of monster puts their self-interest

366
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:06,280
而不告诉另一个人
ahead of telling another human being

367
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:09,360
他们会被传染寄生虫
that they are going to get a parasite infestation?

368
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,618
我觉得你会做同样的事
I feel you would've done the same thing.

369
00:12:10,618 --> 00:12:12,197
-绝不会 -不 克莱尔 住手
- Never. - No, Claire, stop it!

370
00:12:12,197 --> 00:12:14,302
我得出发去开另一个会了
Uh, I got to get off to another meeting.

371
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:15,860
克莱尔 我们别绕圈子了
But, Claire, let's just cut to the chase.

372
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:17,080
这件事就交给你
You got my business.

373
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,200
真是太棒了
Oh, super!

374
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,300
只是握手显然不够诚意吧
Oh, I think we're way past handshakes, huh?

375
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:33,340
曼尼 给你的祖先们一点敬意
Manny, stop disrespecting your ancestors.

376
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:36,444
他们花了650万年才学会直立行走
It took them 6 1/2 million years to walk upright!

377
00:12:36,444 --> 00:12:38,057
你没听导览的介绍吗
Didn't you hear the tour guy?

378
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:38,860
当然
"Duh."

379
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:41,000
别给我摆这种脸色
No, don't give me that attitude.

380
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:43,260
没有 我 你的脸怎么红了
No, I -- why is your face red?

381
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:43,720
什么
What?

382
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:49,220
肯定是我的抗过敏药
It must be my allergy medication.

383
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:50,740
我一定是对药物有过敏反应
I must be overreacting to it!

384
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:52,100
我帮你拿点水吧
Um, I'll get you some water.

385
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,160
那边就有个饮水机
There's a fountain right over there.

386
00:12:55,180 --> 00:12:57,000
曼尼 你一整天都跑哪儿去了
Manny, where have you been all day?

387
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,240
我一直在"翼展"区
I was in the bird wing.

388
00:12:58,660 --> 00:12:59,820
这名字起得真不错 对吧
Hilarious they call it that, no?

389
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,120
你妈妈呢
Where's your mom?

390
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,480
她刚刚还在这儿
She was just there.

391
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,980
她肯定藏起来了
I think she's hiding.

392
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:07,520
她应该是看到我跟她撞衫了
She probably saw she and I were wearing the same outfit

393
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:10,160
怕被我比下去 一直都这样
and didn't want to get outdone...as usual.

394
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,100
也许吧
Uh yeah, maybe.

395
00:13:18,780 --> 00:13:19,800
最重要的是我
But the important thing

396
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,060
能够享受这个过程 对吧
is that I have fun out there, right?

397
00:13:21,180 --> 00:13:22,340
我们再重复一遍
Okay, let's go over this again,

398
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:23,583
因为我觉得你没懂我的意思
'cause I feel like you're not listening.

399
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:25,280
你必须给我赢
I need you to win.

400
00:13:26,260 --> 00:13:26,700
杰 你来了
Hey, Jay.

401
00:13:26,800 --> 00:13:27,300
卢克
Hey, Luke.

402
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,620
别听你爸的
Don't let your dad get in your head.

403
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:30,020
尽力就行了
Get out there and do your best.

404
00:13:30,460 --> 00:13:31,040
没问题
All right.

405
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:32,680
你到底在想什么
What the hell was that?

406
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:34,740
他的对手是格尔·索普的儿子
He's wrestling Gil Thorpe's kid.

407
00:13:34,740 --> 00:13:35,580
我恨死那家伙了
I hate that guy.

408
00:13:35,900 --> 00:13:37,460
总是想方设法让我自惭形秽
Always trying to make me feel like less of a man.

409
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:39,200
是拿走你的项链的那个家伙吗
The guy that took your necklace, right?

410
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:41,080
-那是我的奖牌 -随便你怎么叫
- My medallion! - Call it what you want.

411
00:13:41,260 --> 00:13:44,540
我只是很高兴不用再帮你戴上它了
I'm just glad I don't have to help you with the clasp again.

412
00:13:45,260 --> 00:13:45,680
杰 你在哭吗
Jay, are you crying?

413
00:13:45,820 --> 00:13:46,180
当然不是
No!

414
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:48,720
裁判在座位区喷了消毒剂
Referee sprayed some disinfectant on the mats.

415
00:13:48,820 --> 00:13:50,280
我弄到眼睛里了 你有纸巾吗
I got some in my eye. You got a tissue?

416
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,368
给你
Here you go.

417
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:53,440
送你了
Keep it.

418
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:54,480
那是我老婆的
It's my wife's.

419
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:57,580
-老爸 -儿子
- Hey, dad! - Hey, son!

420
00:13:57,980 --> 00:13:58,880
你能来真好
Good to see you.

421
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:01,120
比赛快要开始了
Uh, the match is about to start... yeah?

422
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,260
也就是说 快要结束了
...which means it's about to finish.

423
00:14:02,671 --> 00:14:05,207
他的对手看起来像棵矮牵牛花
You see that little petunia he's wrestling?

424
00:14:05,854 --> 00:14:07,004
没错
Yes.

425
00:14:08,020 --> 00:14:09,140
你认识格尔他爸吗
You know Gil's dad?

426
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:11,260
他总能看到我最糟糕的时刻
I know he always sees me at my worst.

427
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:13,820
这比赛一定要赢 菲尔
I really want this win, Phil.

428
00:14:13,831 --> 00:14:15,359
非常非常想
I can taste it, like metal.

429
00:14:15,359 --> 00:14:17,256
我也一样
Me, too. Metal.

430
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:19,000
我也搞不懂为什么
I don't know what it is with this guy,

431
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:19,980
但是不管我怎么做
but no matter what I do,

432
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:21,180
我就是赢不了他
I just can't win with him.

433
00:14:21,180 --> 00:14:22,671
我跟他儿子也是这样的
That's the way I am with his son.

434
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,800
还有跟时代华纳电视公司打交道的时候
And Time Warner Cable.

435
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,160
感觉像被阉了一样憋屈
It's emasculating, you know?

436
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:27,260
这不是一个男人应该有的感觉
I mean, it's not a feeling a man should have.

437
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:28,820
杰 你知道爱的开头是什么吗
Jay, you know what the beginning of "Love" is?

438
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:30,440
上帝啊 我们只不过随便聊聊
Oh, for god's sake, we're just talking here.

439
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,800
为什么你总是要
Why do you always have to make everything

440
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:32,740
上纲上线
bigger than it is?!

441
00:14:32,955 --> 00:14:34,352
你好[LO与Hello音似]
L.O.

442
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:35,600
菲尔 听我说
Hey, Phil, listen.

443
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,560
你的药店有卖治虱子的洗发水吗
Does your pharmacy carry lice shampoo?

444
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,740
莉莉在学校被传染了虱子
Lily got it at school.

445
00:14:39,275 --> 00:14:41,740
走开 吓人的机器人
Ooh, away, scary robot!

446
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:42,140
走开
Away!

447
00:14:42,420 --> 00:14:43,840
我不能呼吸了
I can't breathe.

448
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,480
很好 你头上的虫子也不能
Well, good. Neither can your hair pets.

449
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,420
-什么 -没事
- What? - Nothing.

450
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,300
莉莉从什么人身上传染了虱子
Lily got lice from someone.

451
00:14:48,300 --> 00:14:49,899
-肯定是波西亚 -还能是谁
- Portia. - Who else?

452
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:51,400
别去什么药店了
You know what? Skip the pharmacy.

453
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,811
我们那儿有治虱子的东西
Just -- just borrow our lice kit.

454
00:14:52,811 --> 00:14:54,660
在地下室 钥匙在地毯下面
It's in the basement. The key's under the mat.

455
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:55,640
谢谢你 菲尔 谢谢
Thank you, Phil. Thanks.

456
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:57,000
好了
All right!

457
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,660
可以了 吓人的机器人
Enough.. with scary robot!

458
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:02,080
谁想扮成一只坐在车上的狗狗
But who wants to pretend to be a dog and ride in the car?

459
00:15:02,140 --> 00:15:02,640
我
I do!

460
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:03,740
很好 我们门口见
Okay! Meet you at the door!

461
00:15:03,740 --> 00:15:04,440
记着
And remember --

462
00:15:04,450 --> 00:15:06,291
我们要把头伸出车窗外
we're gonna keep our head outside the window.

463
00:15:06,291 --> 00:15:08,420
-真有趣 -是啊 真有趣
- Fun! - Yeah, fun! Uh-huh!

464
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:08,860
真是有趣
Fun.

465
00:15:10,420 --> 00:15:11,780
好了 比赛开始了
All right, the match is starting.

466
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:13,180
我感觉到对胜利的渴望了
I feel that metal now in my mouth,

467
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:14,279
就像你之前说的一样
like you were saying.

468
00:15:14,340 --> 00:15:15,100
万一他输了怎么办
What if he loses?

469
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,340
那也不要表现出失望
Then we hide our disappointment.

470
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:18,040
跟我学学 我都装了好多年了
Follow my lead. I've been doing it for years.

471
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:21,200
孩子需要知道我们永远无条件支持他
The kid needs to know we support him no matter what.

472
00:15:22,197 --> 00:15:24,249
-加油卢克 -卢克加油
- Come on, Luke! - Luke!

473
00:15:45,660 --> 00:15:47,020
好了 他们走了
All right. They're gone.

474
00:15:47,260 --> 00:15:48,500
好 我们赶紧走吧
Okay. Let's get out of here.

475
00:15:48,660 --> 00:15:49,600
靠我近点
Stay close.

476
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:51,120
妈 你简直不可理喻[无与伦比]
Mom, you're unbelievable.

477
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:53,714
你真会说话 不过我知道我看起来很糟
Ay, that's sweet, but I know I look terrible.

478
00:15:53,714 --> 00:15:55,275
你责备我自我意识太强
You come down on me for being self-conscious,

479
00:15:55,275 --> 00:15:57,422
结果你自己因为脸变红了就躲起来
then you run and hide because your face is red.

480
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:58,380
你说得没错
You're right.

481
00:15:58,380 --> 00:16:00,672
我一直怪其他高中生
I keep blaming the high-school boys

482
00:16:00,672 --> 00:16:02,360
老是害你难为情
for making you self-conscious,

483
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:03,640
没想到是我造成的
and you're taking after me.

484
00:16:03,660 --> 00:16:04,860
等我们躲到安全的地方之后
We can assign blame when we're safely

485
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:05,780
再互相指责吧
behind our tinted windows.

486
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,400
-我们被包围了 -才不是呢
- We're trapped! - No.

487
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:10,240
当我在洞穴人展区的时候
When I was in the caveman exhibit,

488
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,600
我发现了防火出口
I discovered fire exits.

489
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,320
上车以后我再跟你解释好笑在哪里
I'll explain to you why that's funny in the car.

490
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:13,740
跟我来
Follow me.

491
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:14,380
不行 曼尼
No, Manny.

492
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:16,820
是时候给你树立一个好榜样了
It's time for me to set a good example for you.

493
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:17,660
好吧
Okay.

494
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:18,920
妈 你要干嘛
Mom, what are you doing?

495
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:20,480
我要证明给你看别人的想法
I'm gonna show you that it's not important

496
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,520
并不重要
what other people think.

497
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:24,060
重要的是要坚持自我
What is important is that you stay true to yourself.

498
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:28,540
那是我妈妈做过最勇敢的事
It was the bravest thing my mom had ever done.

499
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,320
大家好
Hey, everybody!

500
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:33,040
听到我这个吱吱叫的鞋子了吗
Uh, hear my squeaky shoes?

501
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:34,260
太逗了 不是吗
Pretty funny, isn't it?

502
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:37,240
是啊 就是我 吱吱鞋
That's right, it's me -- ol' squeaky shoes.

503
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:37,880
太疯狂了
Crazy!

504
00:16:38,066 --> 00:16:39,545
瞧瞧他那件粉衬衣
Get a load of that pink shirt.

505
00:16:39,545 --> 00:16:40,900
真是太漂亮了
Aww, it's so pretty.

506
00:16:40,900 --> 00:16:41,880
曼尼 上衣很美啊
Hey, Manny, nice top.

507
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:43,014
但你看我的鞋
Uh, but my shoes!

508
00:16:43,014 --> 00:16:44,626
鞋怎么了 小粉红
What about 'em, pink top?

509
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:50,340
那是他做过最勇敢的事情
It was the bravest thing he has ever done.

510
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:51,920
他们叫我小粉红
They call me "Pink top."

511
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,560
我的英雄
My hero.

512
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:54,660
小粉红
Pink top.

513
00:16:57,678 --> 00:17:00,800
比赛太棒了
Hey! Whoo! Good fight!

514
00:17:00,800 --> 00:17:02,860
今天我们搞砸了卢克的比赛
We really blew it with Luke today.

515
00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:03,980
我怎么可以那样做呢
How could I do that?

516
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:07,000
我父亲从来不错过任何机会让我知道
My dad never missed an opportunity to let me know

517
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,580
我让他失望了 我也这么对待我的外孙
when I disappointed him, and I do it to my grandkid.

518
00:17:09,818 --> 00:17:11,260
我也做得不对
It's just as much my fault.

519
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,780
在我妻子身上 我清晰地看见了
I've seen what having a disapproving father

520
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:13,580
一个不认同她的父亲的危害
has done to my wife.

521
00:17:13,580 --> 00:17:14,916
我应该做得更好的
I should've known better.

522
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:15,960
该死
Dang it.

523
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:17,640
伙计 我知道你不开心
Buddy, I know you're upset.

524
00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:18,840
你绝对有权利那样
You've got every right.

525
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:21,400
我们把自己的争执发泄到摔跤比赛上
We made that wrestling match all about our stupid feud.

526
00:17:21,713 --> 00:17:22,720
那是不对的
That was wrong.

527
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:23,620
忘了那些人渣吧
Forget about those jerks.

528
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:25,620
我们对你的感觉只有自豪
We couldn't be anything but proud of you,

529
00:17:25,620 --> 00:17:27,240
就好像我特别为你妈妈感到自豪一样
just like I'm super proud of your mom.

530
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,260
我们先处理眼前这个问题吧
Let's repair this one first.

531
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:31,700
我们只是不想让你因为输了比赛
We just don't want you to beat yourself up

532
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:32,500
而感到自责
because you lost.

533
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:33,300
我没有
I'm not.

534
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,820
我刚开始学习摔跤不久
I just started wrestling.

535
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:37,760
当然 能赢固然好 但我尽力了
Sure, it would've been nice to win, but I tried my best.

536
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:40,100
我刚刚说"该死" 是因为忘了拿吸管
I just said "Dang it" Because I forgot to get a straw.

537
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:43,360
臭小子 他竟然没事
Son of a gun! He's actually okay.

538
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:44,540
我才不信
I don't buy it.

539
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:45,680
为什么 何出此言
Why? What are you talking about?

540
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:48,060
没有孩子可以在让父亲和外公失望后
No kid lets down his father and grandfather

541
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,220
还那么镇定自若
and is that okay with it.

542
00:17:49,220 --> 00:17:50,720
他在掩藏情绪
He's burying his feelings.

543
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:52,620
也许他只是家教比较好
Or maybe he's just raised better than that.

544
00:17:52,620 --> 00:17:54,720
他知道参与别人的战争是没有意义的
He knows it's pointless to fight other people's battles.

545
00:17:54,940 --> 00:17:56,300
这是基因里带的 菲尔
It's all in the DNA, Phil.

546
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,320
我的老爹跟别人有矛盾的时候
My old man has a problem with somebody?

547
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,040
相信我
Trust me

548
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:01,100
我就在操场上找那个家伙的孩子了
I'm looking for that guy's kid on the schoolyard.

549
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:02,540
这是男人的处事方式
It's how men work.

550
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:03,860
曾经的处事方式
Or used to work.

551
00:18:03,860 --> 00:18:05,373
也许那些嗜血的普里契特基因
Maybe those thuggish Pritchett genes

552
00:18:05,383 --> 00:18:07,180
混合了一些更先进的邓菲基因
got mixed with more evolved Dunphy genes,

553
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:08,980
塑造了一个有着更高尚情操的人类
resulting in a more elevated human being.

554
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,600
天哪 他在攻击他
Oh, my god! He's attacking him!

555
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:12,340
放开我的孩子
Hey! Hey! Get off my kid!

556
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,320
你才要放开我的孩子
Hey. Hey! Get off my kid!

557
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:15,703
是你要放开我的孩子
Aah! You get off of my kid!

558
00:18:15,703 --> 00:18:18,260
放开我女儿的老公
Hey, hey! Get off my daughter's husband!

559
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:19,580
管我叫你的孩子会死吗 杰
Would it kill you to call me your kid, Jay?

560
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:23,180
天哪 原来他在救他
Oh, my god. He was saving him.

561
00:18:23,582 --> 00:18:24,726
祝你有愉快的一天
Oh. Have a good day.

562
00:18:24,726 --> 00:18:26,820
结果好 一切好
Well...all's well that ends well.

563
00:18:26,820 --> 00:18:27,900
是啊 我们走吧
Yeah, yeah. Here we go.

564
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:28,708
坐一下 孩子
Grab a seat, son.

565
00:18:28,708 --> 00:18:29,515
-走吧 -这就来
- Move. - Coming in.

566
00:18:29,515 --> 00:18:31,890
我想 还是来个普通汉堡吧
I think, uh, probably just a regular burger.

567
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:37,400
我看不到它了 你觉得它走了吗
I can't see it anymore. You think it's gone?

568
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,220
可能藏起来了
It could be hiding.

569
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:39,840
我有个主意
I have an idea.

570
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:41,840
你要干什么
What are you doing?!

571
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:42,731
我准备分散它的注意力
I'm gonna create a distraction

572
00:18:42,731 --> 00:18:44,571
这样我们可以趁机跑出去
so that we can make a break for it.

573
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:46,760
给点时间预热
Give it a second to warm up.

574
00:18:46,760 --> 00:18:47,840
好的
Okay.

575
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:48,420
它回来了
It's back!

576
00:18:52,820 --> 00:18:54,040
我的天哪
Oh, my gosh.

577
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,660
这下面太黑了
It's so dark down here.

578
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,780
小心点 宝贝
Be careful, sweetie.

579
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:09,140
这下面是怎么了
What is going on down here?!

580
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:15,120
好吧 我不得不承认
All right, I got to admit something right here.

581
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,580
今天你让我很受感动 卢克
You impressed me today, Luke.

582
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:18,680
那个孩子刚刚噎住了
That kid started choking.

583
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:21,380
你眼里看到的不是竞争对手
You didn't see a rival or...

584
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:23,520
或是一个为自己家族而战的机会
...a chance to fight your family's stupid battles.

585
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:25,640
你看到的是一个需要帮助的人
You just saw somebody who needed help.

586
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:28,600
这让你成为了这辆车上最成熟的人
And that makes you the biggest man in this whole car.

587
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:31,700
你刚刚就是想攻击他 对不对
You just attacked him, didn't you?

588
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:33,040
他表现得像噎住了
He made that choke sign.

589
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,600
我以为他在嘲笑我刚才的比赛
I thought he was mocking my wrestling.

590
00:19:37,060 --> 00:19:42,940
-这事我们自己知道就可以了 -是的
- Let's go ahead and keep that to ourselves. - Yeah.

591
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:45,100
我来开吧
I'll get it.

592
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:47,320
亲爱的 我收回之前所说的
Honey, I take back everything I ever said

593
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:48,800
所有关于这个发明的评价
about this stupid invention.

594
00:19:49,060 --> 00:19:50,020
它有名字的
It has a name

595
00:19:50,020 --> 00:19:52,417
注册商标 "真感觉挠头器"
"The real head scratcher, T.M."

596
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,060
请进
Well, come on in.

597
00:19:55,660 --> 00:19:56,960
就是想跟你道个歉 小邓子
Just want to say I'm sorry, "Doofy."

598
00:19:57,005 --> 00:19:57,980
那你还叫我
And yet you're still call--

599
00:19:57,980 --> 00:19:59,760
今天你孩子的所作所为太棒了
What your kid did today was amazing.

600
00:20:00,340 --> 00:20:01,040
你不会记恨我的 对吧
No hard feelings, right?

601
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,320
小卡 手头上的事情先停一下
Hey, Cam, hold off on that thing for a second.

602
00:20:04,420 --> 00:20:05,100
莉莉 亲爱的
Lily, honey?

603
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:06,820
你开玩笑吗 一切都好
Are you kidding me? It's all in good fun.

604
00:20:06,820 --> 00:20:07,620
那就好
All right. Good.

605
00:20:07,620 --> 00:20:09,060
这个小可爱是谁啊
Whoa! Who's this little dumpling?

606
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:10,340
是我的侄女
Only my niece.

607
00:20:10,456 --> 00:20:13,120
她最爱别人把她背在背上
If there's one thing she loves, it's piggy-back.

608
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:13,960
我没有啊
No, I don't.

609
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:15,980
有 快上来
Yep! Hop on up there!

610
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:16,480
好吧
All right!

611
00:20:17,930 --> 00:20:19,380
这人是谁
Who's this man?

612
00:20:19,380 --> 00:20:20,260
你可以叫我格尔叔叔
You can call me uncle Gil!

613
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:21,340
格尔叔叔
Uncle Gil!

614
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:22,780
你们两个看起来很和谐
You two look great together!

615
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,800
抱好了 对了
Get in there! Yeah!

616
00:20:25,420 --> 00:20:27,160
我跟你说 这些小家伙最喜欢我了
I'm telling you, these little buggers love me.

617
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:29,420
要的就是这个效果
That's the plan! Yeah!
